    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Bad_7",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I used to be special to you, your best friend... now you only seem to put up with me when I make a hot dinner.$s",
      "translation": "Dřív jsem pro tebe byla výjimečná, tvoje nejlepší kamarádka... Teď to vypadá, že mě sneseš jen tehdy, když uvařím teplou večeři.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "7c0728050d630413dcfd47fbb3211ce2f3c4eabcbabc94cd4d5f31a0ed0c4c07",
      "translationSHA256": "0fe50334d910a607396d548c54ce23e81b3c7db45b28d08428c4248acbae287d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Bad_8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You've been so cold to me lately... What's wrong with you? You're acting like a bog spirit...$s",
      "translation": "V poslední době se ke mně chováš tak chladně... Co to s tebou je? Chováš se jako močálový duch...$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "4981410c2454931d52e9a7314239541d61f869f5d2c5d40f94488d5c7b5c493d",
      "translationSHA256": "dd53bd6a131774837be5eb533f7422d7083e5338c5843f83fb2c6a21dfd387fc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Bad_9",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wonder if I could've done better... I was very good friends with Sebastian before we met. He was probably the one...$s",
      "translation": "Napadá mě, jestli jsem si nemohla vybrat lépe... Než jsem poznala tebe, byli jsme se Sebastianem dobří přátelé. Možná byl ten pravý...$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "478f3d703030d412b89aba6ef83fcf794933222c23e9aa8190117e50a96f6e93",
      "translationSHA256": "f71c1d8aa131a6e9731d976aad4a77bcf78cd7beb8a0f78b015760288483984f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
