    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "spring_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "So, do you have any big plans for the new year?",
      "translation": "Tak co, máš na nový rok nějaké velké plány?",
      "sourceSHA256": "454858b95abc79e5c913f06f8598b66173f5f156b3973d8a795ca444791c497a",
      "translationSHA256": "ead78abbc9151ae56b95212410793f38bf5327e5ea96e887c5c879132e8a4957",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "spring_12",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, the egg festival is tomorrow. I'm sorry, but I won't go easy on you because we're married!$h#$e#I plan on winning that egg hunt. Go ahead and try to beat me.",
      "translation": "Hej, zítra je Slavnost vajec. Promiň, ale jen proto, že jsme svoji, tě nebudu šetřit!$h#$e#Ten lov vajec hodlám vyhrát. Tak se klidně pokus mě porazit.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e1c734c88a314f55daaabcd791e5f80c9d46ee5ec5c03cf9aee4fe09fb531f23",
      "translationSHA256": "19c85c4b0a53ea8f4a0e52155c9cd86b0e710712ab4077c01366ccaebe9ad377",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "spring_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Do you have any new year's resolutions? I'm trying to lose a few pounds around the middle.$h",
      "translation": "Máš nějaká novoroční předsevzetí? Já se snažím shodit pár kilo kolem pasu.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "c9ae8035000cc23459a331b2b6991074b29f7323baa14dd0c4b7e73eef02b25e",
      "translationSHA256": "ddb34db5c8fa8d9ceb3a1d2e9a5b2e920d1298ae9fd0c9c724ac4960d02de0c0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "summer_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I get sunburnt very easily, so I need to be careful this time of year.#$e#I hope you like me pale!$h",
      "translation": "Velmi snadno se spálím, takže si v tomhle období musím dávat pozor.#$e#Doufám, že se ti líbím bledá!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "e6e144f8067e2f438dd4757565f8b5908451b3981e5c5ff402854e121d37fbda",
      "translationSHA256": "4a1a635b597935e30d9b1d3376c7af4e803d84d031c2f33dede3ef5d3c8fb2ce",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "summer_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Make sure you don't get a heat stroke, my love.#$e#Drink plenty of water and don't overwork yourself.",
      "translation": "Dávej pozor, ať nedostaneš úpal, lásko.#$e#Pij hodně vody a nepřepracuj se.",
      "sourceSHA256": "dd185a97003508c7354076692e245e37cbce1ca8f143a52f67ef2e0a032239ca",
      "translationSHA256": "7c95460ba49ec816eafab498316218c6242a78004703b7affcc6e0d81cd876e4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "summer_8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Sorry about the smell... I was sweating all night in the heat.",
      "translation": "Promiň za ten pach... Celou noc jsem se v tom vedru potila.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c4a26baae4d6583fcac6b1418254e7e20a5b9d0517fdaa8932fb487c9d973d26",
      "translationSHA256": "67e7add5e3c4afd52b918f7d259fe402e2f6227140dbbb009edaa9ea80114340",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
